  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshaoming-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshaoming-wyd:p001:m0000" ref="79g_3gx_htk">海陵王</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshaoming-wyd:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAD">王妃</persName>名<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshaoming-wyd:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAD">韶明</persName>琅邪臨沂人太常<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshaoming-wyd:p001:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBA">慈</persName>女也永明八年納為臨汝公夫人<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshaoming-wyd:p001:m0029" ref="iop_ybd_afm">鬱林</persName>即位為新安王妃延興元年為皇后其年降為海陵王妃</p>
</text>
